{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is Poly Plaza ULTIMATE?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poly Plaza</strong>\u00a0<strong>ULTIMATE</strong> is an enhanced, more complete version of <strong>Poly Plaza,</strong>\u00a0an open-world sandbox game where you get to buy properties, collect rent, and become the richest man in town!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's new?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All DLC's from Poly Plaza are included.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The clothing system has been completly re-worked to not use steam items anymore, instead all clothes can be crafted in-game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is now more alive with NPC's walking arround, cars parked in the streets and a functional day/nigh system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game have a lot of more content, including new items to collect, new vehicles and new craft recipes</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3208170?t=1757566911","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3208170?t=1757566911","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208170/5ab924eb1a3e243b3f4b62175348e9e9e1497b9c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757566911","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208170/5ab924eb1a3e243b3f4b62175348e9e9e1497b9c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757566911","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What is Poly Plaza ULTIMATE?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Poly Plaza</strong>\u00a0<strong>ULTIMATE</strong> is an enhanced, more complete version of <strong>Poly Plaza,</strong>\u00a0an open-world sandbox game where you get to buy properties, collect rent, and become the richest man in town!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What's new?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All DLC's from Poly Plaza are included.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The clothing system has been completly re-worked to not use steam items anymore, instead all clothes can be crafted in-game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is now more alive with NPC's walking arround, cars parked in the streets and a functional day/nigh system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game have a lot of more content, including new items to collect, new vehicles and new craft recipes</p></li></ul>","developers":["Victor Game Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3208170/1733322eaf173b5b69d76c30aef76f7bc1a7dbdd/header.jpg?t=1757566911","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3208170/1591313050/2fbf787b962ae89bc7c88c80da85573b0d0fae22/1756418593/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756419421","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3208170/1591313050/2fbf787b962ae89bc7c88c80da85573b0d0fae22/1756418593/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756419421","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3208170/1591313050/2fbf787b962ae89bc7c88c80da85573b0d0fae22/1756418593/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756419421","id":257190414,"name":"Poly Plaza ULTIMATE - Short Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257190414/163194bc7126d02ebeaccd67f5c5333c9dd6